<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch about your experience at our <strong><em>Qantas Club/our Business/First/Partner Lounge</em></strong>- at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} airport on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If guests turned away use:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We want every departure to be smooth and enjoyable, so I was sorry to hear that we were unable to accommodate your guests on this occasion. I understand your disappointment.<br />
<br />
Lounge access is subject to capacity limitations and there was significant demand that day due to <em><strong>-ongoing renovations/sporting event/storms-</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
When this happens, priority access is given to our premium Frequent Flyers and those who have paid for membership.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>-If Qantas Club member with no tier use:-</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Qantas Club members</strong><br />
<br />
We want your departure to be as smooth and comfortable as possible, so I understand your disappointment when you were refused entry to the lounge when travelling with our partner airline {{{Case.Airline__c}}}.<br />
<br />
The Qantas Club program operates independently of the oneworld alliance and your membership benefits are separate from those offered through the Frequent Flyer program.<br />
<br />
As a Qantas Club member, you need to book a Qantas flight number to access Qantas and Partner lounges when travelling in Economy on our partner airlines.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>-If inappropriately dressed use:-</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Our lounge dress code</strong><br />
<br />
We want your departure to be as smooth as possible and understand your disappointment when you were refused entry to our lounge.<br />
<br />
While we understand that being declined at the door is never a good experience, our lounges have smart casual dress guidelines in place.<br />
<br />
We received considerable feedback that these were not being enforced, so our domestic teams in Adelaide, Brisbane, Canberra, Melbourne, Perth and Sydney may deny entry if some items of clothing are deemed too casual.<br />
<br />
These guidelines are intended to create an environment that everyone can enjoy, and we look forward to welcoming you into our lounge soon.<br />
<br />
<br />
View our <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/qantas-experience/at-the-airport/airport-lounges/qantas-lounge-access-eligibility.html" target="_blank">&nbsp;lounge access eligibility</a>&nbsp;page for more information.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed your feedback on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience, I hope we deliver an exceptional service next time you fly with us.</p>
</body>
